**Summary of findings:**

| Severity | Count | Key Issue |
|----------|-------|-----------|
| Critical | 1 | No iteration between thermal and humidity solvers within each timestep (one-pass sequential, no convergence loop) |
| High | 2 | HPWH writes `latent_gain_w` without a `Humidity` port; no runtime cross-validation that Thermal `latent_gain_w` equals Humidity `moisture_mass_flow_kg_s * h_fg` |
| Medium | 2 | No Lewis relation for convective heat/mass transfer (no surface condensation model); invariant check hardcodes h_fg instead of using config |
| Low | 1 | Moisture invariant check ignores Humidity accumulator stream entirely |
